<div id="similarity-checker-root" class="similarity-checker-root">
  <header class="similarity-checker-header">
    <h1 class="similarity-checker-title">{{ page.title }}</h1>
    {% if page.description %}
      <p class="similarity-checker-description">{{ page.description }}</p>
    {% endif %}
  </header>

  <div class="similarity-explanation mt-3">
    <p>
      Molecular similarity is calculated by comparing molecular fingerprints $A$ and $B$, where $a = |A|$ and $b = |B|$ represent the number of set features in each molecule, and $c = |A \cap B|$ is the count of shared features:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>Tanimoto Similarity ($T$):</strong> Calculates the proportion of shared features relative to the union of all features present across both molecules:
        $$T(A, B) = \frac{|A \cap B|}{|A \cup B|} = \frac{c}{a + b - c}$$
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Dice Similarity ($D$):</strong> Measures shared features relative to the average fingerprint size, giving double weight to common features:
        $$D(A, B) = \frac{2|A \cap B|}{|A| + |B|} = \frac{2c}{a + b}$$
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <form id="similarity-checker-form" class="similarity-checker-form" novalidate>
    <div class="form-group">
      <label for="similarity-library">Library SMILES</label>
      <textarea
        id="similarity-library"
        class="form-control similarity-library-input"
        rows="6"
        placeholder="CCO, c1ccccc1, CC(=O)O, c1ccc(O)cc1"
        spellcheck="false"
      ></textarea>
      <div class="similarity-delimiter-row">
        <small id="similarity-delimiter-hint" class="form-text text-muted similarity-delimiter-hint" hidden></small>
        <select
          id="similarity-delimiter"
          class="form-control form-control-sm similarity-delimiter-select"
          aria-label="Delimiter"
        >
          <option value="auto" selected>Auto-detect</option>
          <option value=",">Comma</option>
          <option value="newline">Newline</option>
          <option value="tab">Tab</option>
          <option value="semicolon">Semicolon</option>
        </select>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="form-group">
      <label for="similarity-query">Query SMILES</label>
      <input
        type="text"
        id="similarity-query"
        class="form-control"
        placeholder="c1ccccc1"
        spellcheck="false"
      >
    </div>

    <div class="form-group similarity-options-row">
      <div class="similarity-topk-group">
        <label for="similarity-topk">Top k</label>
        <input
          type="number"
          id="similarity-topk"
          class="form-control similarity-topk-input"
          value="10"
          min="1"
          max="1000"
        >
      </div>

      <div class="similarity-fp-size-group">
        <label for="similarity-fp-size">Fingerprint size</label>
        <select id="similarity-fp-size" class="form-control similarity-fp-size-select">
          <option value="64">64</option>
          <option value="128">128</option>
          <option value="256">256</option>
          <option value="512">512</option>
          <option value="1024" selected>1024</option>
          <option value="2048">2048</option>
        </select>
      </div>
    </div>

    <button type="submit" id="similarity-search-btn" class="btn btn-primary similarity-search-btn" disabled>
      Search
    </button>
  </form>

  <p id="similarity-status" class="similarity-status" role="status">Loading RDKit…</p>

  <div id="similarity-results" class="similarity-results" hidden>
    <h2 class="similarity-results-title">Results</h2>
    <p>
      Search results are ranked in descending order based on the sum of both metric scores ($Score = T + D$).
    </p>
    <div class="table-responsive">
      <table class="table table-striped similarity-results-table">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th scope="col">Rank</th>
            <th scope="col">Structure</th>
            <th scope="col">SMILES</th>
            <th scope="col">Tanimoto</th>
            <th scope="col">Dice</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody id="similarity-results-body"></tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
